  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "shannon.cox@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.425 per share payable on January 31, 2017 to shareholders of record at the close of business on December 30, 2016, representing an increase of 12% versus the prior year and the previous quarter.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2016/Stryker-increases-2017-annual-dividend-by-12-and-declares-a-0425-per-share-quarterly-dividend/default.aspx\">Read the full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2019 17:48:24 GMT+0000",
